OL,3,GNEWSAMan found guilty of sex assault on
OL,4,Asleeping woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been convicted of sexually
OL,7,Fassaulting a woman who awoke to find
OL,8,Fhim touching her without consent.
OL,10,FAmardip Dhariwal, 55, of Derley Road,
OL,11,FSouthall, was found guilty of
OL,12,Fassaulting the woman at his Bracknell
OL,13,Fhome after they spent a night
OL,14,Fsocialising in May 2022.
OL,16,FShe pretended she was still asleep as
OL,17,Fthe assault concluded, fearing how
OL,18,FDhariwal would react on being
OL,19,Fdisturbed. But once it was over, she
OL,20,Ffled, called a friend for help and
OL,21,Flater reported him to the police.
